{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "english", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1543622400, "end_date": 1544313599, "month_true_total": 474, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:19:00 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "47401300", "author": {"steamid": "76561197965409772", "personaname": "Jarzka", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/jarzka/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 94, "playtime_forever": 837, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 312, "last_played": 1669412411, "avatar": "c5f599d628229116a0e00360f3b1b5718316aa53"}, "language": "english", "review": "🌲/5", "timestamp_created": 1544310012, "timestamp_updated": 1544310012, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.483716309070587158", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47401211", "author": {"steamid": "76561198102800839", "personaname": "RunicEnergy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RunicEnergy/", "num_games_owned": 267, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 5393, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3369, "last_played": 1674621366, "avatar": "0cd64cbef52ffcd0bc172c400aa2376d30d4d7e5"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game is certainly something.\n\nThe graphics are appealing, the gameplay is simple yet expansive, and it's incredibly satisfying to blast space bugs into oblivion. Mining feels good and the selection of minerals is adequate, though the excavator in me hopes to see more in the future.\n\nThat said, it is still early access, so expect bugs.", "timestamp_created": 1544309689, "timestamp_updated": 1544309689, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47401028", "author": {"steamid": "76561198124634152", "personaname": "Migz", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198124634152/", "num_games_owned": 385, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 3538, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1077, "last_played": 1752983735, "avatar": "1434cb79e1d804447b4c2949090dbef2943679db"}, "language": "english", "review": "Great devs, always being updated, really fun with friends", "timestamp_created": 1544308997, "timestamp_updated": 1544308997, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47400418", "author": {"steamid": "76561197960555921", "personaname": "Tsujigiri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/punchinator/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 871, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 534, "last_played": 1690420223, "avatar": "960f72812850a87afe3bb014036e4811822ed4f5"}, "language": "english", "review": "As Rocket league is just a ripp off from an old unreal tournament mod, this deep rock galactic too is a rip off from old unreal tournament invasion.\nBeing a ripp off is not so bad in this game because they added the digging paradigm and it yields in a cool \"good vibe\" atmoshpere.\n\nso far i encountered some problems like :\n- the driller being quite useless.\n- the framerate that can get extremely low.\n- the game needs a TPS view option switchable ingame to FPS.\n- the game needs a 3D radar like in the space dogfights games.\n- the integrated 3D radar needs to be activated and blocks any other actions.\n- there is no idication of the wherabouts of teamates and loosing the team happens very often.\n- seems like there is no dedicated servers and game session get regullarly killed just before extraction, player gets trolled.\n- the mission objectives are sometime indicated, sometimes theres no clue to what the player have to do.\n\nBut even with all those problems i get pleasure excavating in this game.", "timestamp_created": 1544307005, "timestamp_updated": 1544307005, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.475113123655319214", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "47400105", "author": {"steamid": "76561197972818700", "personaname": "Coron Bale", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197972818700/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 6740, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5956, "last_played": 1688919808, "avatar": "1a7e997c62aca77648d31f46144967b1bba1a7b4"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of the smoothest, seemless, bugless (no wait, FILLED WITH BUGS, but ones you can shoot), and mechanically sound shooters I have played to date.  If half the AAA games could nail shooter mechanics as well as this company did, gaming would improve signifigantly!", "timestamp_created": 1544306124, "timestamp_updated": 1544306124, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.5", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}